<view class="detail-page page-with-bg">
  <image class="page-bg" src="/assets/study-bg.png" mode="widthFix" aria-hidden="true" />

  <view class="detail-content">
    <view class="detail-hero">
      <view class="detail-kicker">入门 · 约 3 分钟</view>
      <view class="detail-hero__title">人工耳蜗怎么帮人听见？</view>
      <view class="detail-hero__desc">先不用记术语。你只要理解一件事：它把声音里的关键信息，换成听神经能接收的电信号。</view>
      <image
        class="detail-hero__visual"
        src="/assets/icons/learn-detail-hero.svg"
        mode="aspectFit"
        aria-hidden="true"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="key-card">
      <view class="key-card__icon">
        <hlm-icon name="learn-detail-intro" size="52" color="#2be2d3" />
      </view>
      <view class="key-card__body">
        <view class="section-eyebrow">先记住一句话</view>
        <view class="key-card__title">人工耳蜗不是声音放大器</view>
        <view class="key-card__text">助听器更像“把声音调大”，人工耳蜗更像“把声音翻译”。它把声音处理成一组电刺激，再交给听神经和大脑去学习理解。</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="section-head">
      <view class="section-number">01</view>
      <view>
        <view class="section-title">它到底做了什么？</view>
        <view class="section-desc">可以先把它想成三步：收集、整理、传递。</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="plain-list">
      <view class="plain-item">
        <view class="plain-item__icon">
          <hlm-icon name="learn-detail-step-band" size="42" color="#2be2d3" />
        </view>
        <view class="plain-item__body">
          <view class="plain-item__title">收集声音</view>
          <view class="plain-item__text">外部处理器上的麦克风先接收周围声音。</view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="plain-item">
        <view class="plain-item__icon">
          <hlm-icon name="learn-detail-step-envelope" size="42" color="#67b9ff" />
        </view>
        <view class="plain-item__body">
          <view class="plain-item__title">挑出关键线索</view>
          <view class="plain-item__text">系统会重点保留声音的强弱、节奏和频率范围。</view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="plain-item">
        <view class="plain-item__icon">
          <hlm-icon name="learn-detail-step-electrode" size="42" color="#ffbd3d" />
        </view>
        <view class="plain-item__body">
          <view class="plain-item__title">传给听神经</view>
          <view class="plain-item__text">植入体把这些线索变成电刺激，通过电极传递给听神经。</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="section-head">
      <view class="section-number">02</view>
      <view>
        <view class="section-title">声音的处理路径</view>
        <view class="section-desc">从外界声音到“大脑听懂”，中间大致会经过这条路。</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="path-card">
      <view class="path-row">
        <view class="path-node path-node--active">声音</view>
        <view class="path-arrow">→</view>
        <view class="path-node">处理器</view>
      </view>
      <view class="path-row">
        <view class="path-node">电极</view>
        <view class="path-arrow">→</view>
        <view class="path-node">听神经</view>
        <view class="path-arrow">→</view>
        <view class="path-node">大脑</view>
      </view>
      <view class="path-note">真正“听懂”的部分发生在大脑。刚使用人工耳蜗时，很多声音需要重新熟悉和练习。</view>
    </view>

    <view class="section-head">
      <view class="section-number">03</view>
      <view>
        <view class="section-title">为什么听起来不完全一样？</view>
        <view class="section-desc">自然耳蜗和人工耳蜗都在传递声音信息，但精细程度不同。</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="compare-card">
      <view class="compare-row">
        <view class="compare-icon compare-icon--natural">
          <hlm-icon name="learn-detail-compare-normal" size="42" color="#67b9ff" />
        </view>
        <view class="compare-body">
          <view class="compare-title">自然耳蜗</view>
          <view class="compare-text">依靠大量毛细胞，把声音频率分得很细，能保留更多音色和音高细节。</view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="compare-row">
        <view class="compare-icon compare-icon--ci">
          <hlm-icon name="learn-detail-compare-ci" size="42" color="#2be2d3" />
        </view>
        <view class="compare-body">
          <view class="compare-title">人工耳蜗</view>
          <view class="compare-text">依靠有限数量的电极传递关键线索，更擅长帮助理解语音，但声音细节会被简化。</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="map-card">
      <view class="map-card__copy">
        <view class="section-eyebrow">补充理解</view>
        <view class="map-card__title">耳蜗里有一张“频率地图”</view>
        <view class="map-card__text">高频和低频声音，会对应耳蜗里的不同位置。人工耳蜗会参考这张地图，把不同频率的信息交给不同电极。</view>
      </view>
      <image
        class="map-card__image"
        src="/assets/icons/learn-detail-cochlea-map.svg"
        mode="aspectFit"
        aria-hidden="true"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="tip-card">
      <view class="tip-card__icon">
        <hlm-icon name="learn-warning" size="36" color="#ffbd3d" />
      </view>
      <view class="tip-card__body">
        <view class="tip-card__title">科普提示</view>
        <view class="tip-card__text">本页内容用于帮助理解原理，不代表任何个体的真实听觉效果，也不能替代专业医疗建议。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
